      on-robot control and the 3D views operators trust.
    </p>
    <a
      class="min-h-tap bg-bronze text-body text-bronze-ink hover:bg-bronze/85 inline-flex w-fit items-center px-5 font-medium transition-colors duration-150"
      href="mailto:ankitt335407@gmail.com"
